  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw4000.html",
  "prefLabel": "Sw 4001.05 Validation Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 4001.05 Validation Requirements.\n\n(a) A winning ticket shall be eligible to receive a prize if the following are true:\n\n(1) The winning ticket shall have been issued from an on-line terminal by an authorized lottery agent;\n\n(2) The winning ticket information shall have been recorded in the central computer system at least 59 minutes prior to the drawing;\n\n(3) All information appearing on the winning ticket shall correspond precisely with the lottery's computer record;\n\n(4) The 15 digit validation number and bar code shall appear in its entirety;\n\n(5) The winning ticket shall be intact, fully legible and correspond to the art work on file at the lottery;\n\n(6) The ticket shall not be defectively printed, fuzzy, unreadable, blank or partially blank, or defective; and\n\n(7) The ticket shall not be counterfeit in whole or in part, altered, reconstructed, tampered with in any manner, stolen or misregistered.\n\nSource. #6606, eff 10-22-97, rpld by #7403, eff 11-15-00\n\nNew. #7728, eff 7-23-02; ss by #9165, eff 5-31-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw4000.html"
}
